  "prefLabel": "En 502.12 Landfill gas",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 502.12 \"Landfill gas\" means any flammable consisting primarily of methane and carbon dioxide and produced by aerobic and anaerobic decomposition of organic solid waste in a landfill.\n\nSource. #13796, eff 10-25-23",
